## More

Open **Tsk: Open Stats** for an activity heatmap of your tasks across the year, and **Tsk: Open Task List** for a searchable, sortable table — fuzzy search, Excel-style header filters on status / tags / priority, click-to-jump — try them against `many-tasks.tsk`.

The cache powers tag search and the lenses — run **Tsk: Rebuild Cache** if anything looks stale. Every `tsk.*` setting is documented in the README. It's all plain text you own.
